                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset contains a selection of ordinances issued during the 14th century by Ghent's city government. Selected ordinances deal with public health issues: circulation, public sanitation, trade and market regulations, zoning of crafts, immoral behaviours, animals, water management and fire safety.</p>"
